A REQUEST THAT IS NOT A LICENSE CONDITION

CC BY lets you reuse the numbers in this text freely, and that is intended.
One request that the license does not and cannot enforce:

The measurements here come from three matchmaking matches on one map at one
tickrate. Values like "1.69x" or "0.000335693 degrees" are what those three
demos showed. They are not constants of Counter-Strike, of human motor
control, or of anything else. If you quote them, quote the sample size with
them. The whole point of the text is that measurements without their
measurement conditions are how people end up confidently wrong.
